			(property "Description" "12 MHz crystal, CL 10 pF, ESR 50 Ohm max, +/-30 ppm tolerance and stability, -40..+85 C, 3.2 x 2.5 mm. The crystal RP2350 is qualified with (Raspberry Pi Pico 2): the 50 Ohm ESR ceiling is what the 1 kOhm XOUT damping resistor is tuned for. Pins 1 and 3 are the terminals, 2 and 4 the case ground."
